{"id":135831794,"slug":"zuranolone-is-a-worse-treatment-for","title":"Zuranolone is a Worse Treatment for Post-Partum Depression than Brexanolone","subtitle":"A story in two pictures.","post_date":"2023-08-09T11:34:50.691Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/zuranolone-is-a-worse-treatment-for","wordcount":155,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:57:47.477Z","body_sha256":"a0d7cb015ce649dad8b53a31f51b47862f70c83e716f225e03a521ce24d9216b","text_words":185,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>There has been much talk about the oral medication: zuranolone.  It is for post-partum depression.  It is <em>not</em> a revolutionary treatment.  It works…here is the outcome from the FDA approval trial:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FprI!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb8560010-b787-4d72-b419-ce1920731ad0_1290x1138.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FprI!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb8560010-b787-4d72-b419-ce1920731ad0_1290x1138.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FprI!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb8560010-b787-4d72-b419-ce1920731ad0_1290x1138.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FprI!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb8560010-b787-4d72-b419-ce1920731ad0_1290x1138.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FprI!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressi